# site_engine/site_seccomp.json - the system call filter every site container runs under on the
# site container engine (specs/site_container_engine.md D5): Docker's own default profile, so a
# site there is filtered exactly as on a Docker host. Podman's built-in default lets a process
# with no CAP_SYS_ADMIN make user namespaces (unshare -U as www-data succeeded on 6.1.4,
# 2026-10-14); this one refuses them, as Docker does.
#
# Copied unchanged from upstream; replace it only with another release's file, and this record
# with it. Licence: Apache-2.0 (https://github.com/moby/profiles/blob/main/LICENSE).
